### 揩1 | _(1)H(a/)i_ [[haai1]]

$$
R
  ⼿ + 9
U
  U+63E9
F
  ==
  - (F2.25 揩) ::[虛佳切擦]也[磨]也::
  ==
W
  ====
  - [[Page~69 (1)揩]]
    ==
    - To rub, to wipe [[Kangxi: 摩拭也]];
    - _(1)h(a/)i (1)kon tseng(6)_
        [[haai1 gon1 zeng6 揩乾淨]]
        wipe [shoes] clean;
    - _(1)h(a/)i (4)mo_
        [[haai1 mo4 揩磨]],
        to scour off (as rust);
    - _(1)h(a/)i (4)m(a/)i (4)ts(')(e/)ung_
        [[haai1 maai4 coeng4 揩埋牆]]^
        rub it on the wall;
    - _(5)n(i/) mok(9) (1)h(a/)i (1)ts(')an (5)ngo_
        [[nei5 mok6 haai1 can1 ngo5 你莫揩嚫我]],
        don't rub against me;
    - _(1)h(a/)i ~~ts(')at(7)~~ ``ts(')(a/)t(8)``_
        [[haai1 caat3 揩擦]]
        to rub (as with sandpaper).
    ==
  ====
C
  ==
  - Fan Wan entry: Corrected ⿸虍皿 to 虛, corrected malformed 佳切擦,
    and fixed missing final stroke in 磨.
  - Williams' 揩擦: Corrected _ts(')at(7)_ (cat1) to _ts(')(a/)t(8)_ (caat3).
  ==
E
  ====
  - 【揩】 (haai1)
    ++
    1. To brush against.
       ==
       - 揩到佢架車 (haai1 dou3-2 keoi5 gaa3 ce1): "Brushed against his car."
       - 揩花咗 (haai1 faa1 zo2): "Scratched [from being] brushed against."
       ==
    ++
  ====
S
  ==
